ons\">Action</a></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/38px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/50px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Throw</a> the potion to grant <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">resistance</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/29px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/39px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">Cold</span></a> damage for all creatures in a small <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"1 m (3 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠1 m (3 ft) radius.</li>\n<li>Replaces effects of other elixirs when applied this way as well.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Cold_Resistance\"> Condition: Cold Resistance </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold_Resistance_(Condition)\" title=\"Cold Resistance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/ELX_Elixir_of_Cold_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Elixir_of_Cold_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/ELX_Elixir_of_Cold_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-ELX_Elixir_of_Cold_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/ELX_Elixir_of_Cold_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-ELX_Elixir_of_Cold_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold Resistance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/ELX_Elixir_of_Cold_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Elixir_of_Cold_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/ELX_Elixir_of_Cold_Resistance_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cold_Resistance_(Condition)\" title=\"Cold Resistance (Condition)\">Cold Resistance</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25p